# kin/child/head/brow_soft: the child's soft brows: 2 px of hair step 2 on the row above the lash (they show where the
# fringe parts)
# The child's soft brows (KIN-CHILD). Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h.
use person
body child
role brow soft
layer face
anchor head
keys rest
tags overlay mirror-ok

view D key rest origin -2 -4
|cc....cc

view U key rest origin 0 0
|.

view R key rest origin -9 -4
|cc

view L key rest origin -2 -4
|cc
